sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as HTTP Client
    participant E as Inbound HTTP Endpoint
    participant R as Router
    participant H as Local Handler
    C ->> E: POST /events
    Note over E,R: Process Inbound Event
    E ->> R: handle(Event)
    Note over R: Route Inbound Event
    alt known local capability
        R ->> H: Delegate to Capability
        H -->> R: Event (response)
        R -->> E: Event
        E -->> C: HTTP response
    else unknown capability
        R -->> E: error event (HandlerNotFoundException)
        E -->> C: HTTP 200, error payload
    else handler raises a failure
        R ->> H: Delegate to Capability
        H -->> R: EventHandlingException
        R -->> E: error event
        E -->> C: HTTP 200, error payload
    end
    Note over R,H: Code: io.eventbob.core.EventBob#processEvent, EventResource / inbound controller, EventDto
    Note over R,H: Tests: EventBobTest
